' SuperCPU detection / enable / disable:
' 10/27/2026: as 4480-4482 did: with flag $34 set, 4470 sets flag $35 (and
' pokes 53371), 4472 clears it (and pokes 53370); with $34 clear, neither
' does anything
4470 &,52,$34,3:if a% then poke 53371,0:&,52,$35,1
4471 return
4472 &,52,$34,3:if a% then poke 53370,0:&,52,$35,0
4473 return
' 4470 &,52,$34,3:on-(a%=.)goto4482:poke53371,0:&,52,$35,1:goto4482
' 4471 &,52,$34,3:on-(a%=.)goto4482:poke53370,0:&,52,$35,0
' 4472 return
