4499 gosub4470:print#131,"ath1":tr%=101:poke{sym:clock},.:poke53248,1:zz=1:a$="lo."+"im":goto{$37}0
' 10/27/2026: lightbar Trc right (Time: Reset Clock) re-reads the clock with
' sub.clocks im=11, as in Image 3.0 (22c8d09, 4d6018d): whatever the method saved
' in e.data record 37 (CMD device, DS12C887, Ultimate, TeensyROM), quietly;
' nothing for manual or the last AutoMaint date (that would set the clock
' back). It replaced CMD-only code (4500-4528), which skipped every other
' method. sub.clocks takes sub.modem's place at 60000; the idle loop loads it
' again
4500 &,52,25,.:b$="update time":x=11:gosub{$33}080:close2:im=11:a$="clocks":gosub{$37}4:return
4530 rem "i/lo.idle (c)nissa 2023-07-11, 2026-10-22 rs"
